accumulate "/home/jfs/mmt/content/MathHub/MMT/LATIN2/export/lf-elpi/content/latin..NONE/$Dependent$Functions".

/* generated from eta : {A,B,F:tm (depfun A [x:tm A]B x)}ded (equal (depfun A [x:tm A]B x) (deplambda A ([x:tm A]B x) [x]depapply A ([x:tm A]B x) F x) F) */

ded X1 (equal (depfun A x \ B x) (deplambda A (x \ B x) x \ depapply A (x \ B x) F x) F) :- help/eta A B F X1.

help/eta A B F (prodcert X1/1 X1/2) :- help/eta A B F X1/1 , help/eta A B F X1/2.

help/eta A B F (idcert X2) :- X2 > 0 , X1 is X2 - 1.

help/eta A B F (ptcert (eta A B F)).

